[{"kind":"class","name":"GeometryLinearRing","tags":[{"originalTitle":"aliasclass","title":"aliasclass","text":"Geometry.LinearRing","value":"Geometry.LinearRing"},{"originalTitle":"deprecatedclass","title":"deprecatedclass","text":"SuperMap.Geometry.LinearRing","value":"SuperMap.Geometry.LinearRing"},{"originalTitle":"category","title":"category","text":"BaseTypes Geometry","value":"BaseTypes Geometry"}],"classdesc":"<p>几何对象线环类，是一个特殊的封闭的线串，在每次 addPoint/removePoint 之后会通过添加一个点（此点是复制的第一个点得到的）\n作为最后的一个点来自动关闭线环。</p>","augments":["GeometryLineString"],"params":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<GeometryPoint>"]},"description":"<p>组成线性环的点。</p>","name":"points"}],"examples":["var points = [new GeometryPoint(4933.319287022352, -3337.3849141502124),\n     new GeometryPoint(4960.9674060199022, -3349.3316322355736),\n     new GeometryPoint(5006.0235999418364, -3358.8890067038628),\n     new GeometryPoint(5075.3145648369318, -3378.0037556404409),\n     new GeometryPoint(5305.19551436013, -3376.9669111768926)],\nvar linearRing = new GeometryLinearRing(points);"],"usage":{"className":"GeometryLinearRing","aliasClass":"Geometry.LinearRing","globalParams":{"monospaceLinks":true,"cleverLinks":true,"default":{"outputSourceFiles":false},"namespace":"mapboxgl.supermap","moduleName":"mapboxgl","npm":"@supermapgis/iclient-mapboxgl","cdn":"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js"},"deprecatedClasses":["SuperMap.Geometry.LinearRing"],"deprecatedClassInstance":null,"browserNamespace":""},"longname":"GeometryLinearRing","scope":"global","usageCodeBrowser":"<script type='text/javascript' src=\"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  new mapboxgl.supermap.Geometry.LinearRing(points);\n  // 弃用的写法\n  new SuperMap.Geometry.LinearRing(points);\n</script>","usageCodeES6":"import { GeometryLinearRing } from '@supermapgis/iclient-mapboxgl';\n\nnew GeometryLinearRing(points);"},{"kind":"member","name":"componentTypes","type":{"names":["Array.<string>"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":"[\"SuperMap.Geometry.Point\"]","description":"<p>components 存储的几何对象所支持的几何类型数组，为空表示类型不受限制。</p>","readonly":true,"memberof":"GeometryLinearRing","longname":"GeometryLinearRing#componentTypes","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeometryLineString#componentTypes"},{"kind":"function","name":"addComponent","description":"<p>添加一个点到几何图形数组中，如果这个点将要被添加到组件数组的末端，并且与数组中已经存在的最后一个点相同，\n重复的点是不能被添加的。这将影响未关闭环的关闭。\n这个方法可以通过将非空索引（组件数组的下标）作为第二个参数重写。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["GeometryPoint"]},"description":"<p>点对象。</p>","name":"point"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>插入组件数组的下标。</p>","name":"index"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"description":"<p>点对象是否添加成功。</p>"}],"memberof":"GeometryLinearRing","longname":"GeometryLinearRing#addComponent","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeometryLineString#addComponent"},{"kind":"function","name":"removeComponent","description":"<p>从几何组件中删除一个点。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["GeometryPoint"]},"description":"<p>点对象。</p>","name":"point"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"description":"<p>点对象是否删除。</p>"}],"memberof":"GeometryLinearRing","longname":"GeometryLinearRing#removeComponent","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeometryLineString#removeComponent"},{"kind":"function","name":"getArea","description":"<p>获得当前几何对象区域大小，如果是沿顺时针方向的环则是正值，否则为负值。</p>","returns":[{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>环的面积。</p>"}],"memberof":"GeometryLinearRing","longname":"GeometryLinearRing#getArea","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeometryLineString#getArea"},{"kind":"function","name":"getVertices","description":"<p>返回几何图形的所有点的列表。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>对于线来说，仅仅返回作为端点的顶点，如果设为 false ，则返回非端点的顶点，如果没有设置此参数，则返回所有顶点。</p>","name":"nodes"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array"]},"description":"<p>几何对象所有点的列表。</p>"}],"memberof":"GeometryLinearRing","longname":"GeometryLinearRing#getVertices","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeometryLineString#getVertices"}]